<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on CCH Dexia.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on CCH Dexia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued one million American-style call warrants on shares of Gemeentekrediet/Credit Communal Holdings - Dexia, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,400 BEF		 PREMIUM	8.82 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     278 BEF		   GEARING	12.15 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   05.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	07.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3,380 BEF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
